      "content": "\"Goblin's Gambit\"? What are you talking about? This isn't a game, I'm literally describing a hazardous chemical situation in a professional shop. \n\nCut the nonsense and stay focused. You didn't finish your last point about stabilization. If the temperature is still rising despite the cooling measures, what is the specific technical protocol to stabilize the cell? I need to know exactly how to prevent an explosion right now.",
